<title>USA: Columbia/HCA names Robert Stearns CFO.</title>
<headline>Columbia/HCA names Robert Stearns CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Columbia/HCA Healthcare Corp said today it named Robert Stearns as its chief financial officer, effective July 21.</p>
<p>Officials from the company were not immediately available to comment further.</p>
<p>In his new position, Stearns, 45, will be responsible for development, treasury, investor relations, accounting, risk management, tax and financial planning, the company said.</p>
<p>Stearns joins Columbia from Dial Corp, where he was chief financial officer since July 1996.</p>
</text>
